message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "procedural-augmentation-arc"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Abhijeet Bhattacharya"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abhijeet399/procedural-augmentation-arc"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-07-04
abstract: >
  A controlled, audited application of procedural data generation (re-ARC generators)
  to a transductive ARC-AGI-1 solver, with a data-leakage audit and correction, and
  test-time-training / candidate-rescoring / meta-encoder prototypes. Builds on the
  mdlARC training pipeline (https://github.com/mvakde/mdlARC) by Mithil Vakde; see
  NOTICE.md for the file-level attribution breakdown.
